 "A WARN ",
 StyleBox["Regulator.unusedShapes",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 "; the stage is valid (a regulator need not touch every entry), the warning \
only flags a likely typo."
